ementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8211; Private Transportation: 4&#215;4 pick up truck or van, boat<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8211; Bi-lingual tour guide from the area<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8211; Accommodation: lodges, tents<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8211; 3 meals per day prepared by a professional chef: breakfast, lunch, and dinner.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">* note: final dinner will be in Cusco after completion of tour and isn\u2019t included\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8211; Daily snacks: fruit, cookies, crackers, juice, fruit.\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">*Let us know if you have any dietary requests or allergies<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8211; Rubber boots**, Rain poncho<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8211; Drinking water (bring a reusable water bottle to fill up each day)\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8211; First Aid kit\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">**If you wear boot size 47 or bigger, let us know. These sizes of boots are not available in Peru<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7bc0945 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7bc0945\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>how to book:<\/h3><div>We ask for a deposit of 25% per person to reserve your tour. The rest of the payment can be submitted when you arrive in Peru.\u00a0<\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Live Like a Local book your Perfect Jungle Adventure Previous Next Live Like a Local 4 Days\/ 3 Nights Overview Enjoy a taste of daily life in the Peruvian jungle. Spend a few days visting a local town, trying local flavors, all the while savoring the surrounding nature.\u00a0 Highlights Travel by boat on the river, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-7434","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v22.6 (Yoast SEO v26.3) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Live Like A Local 4D- 3N &#8211; Hidden Jungle Cusco<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Enjoy a taste of daily life in the Peruvian jungle. Visit a local town, try local flavors, and savor the surrounding nature.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.hiddenjunglecusco.com\/live-like-a-local-4d-3n\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Live Like A Local 4D- 3N\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Enjoy a taste of daily life in the Peruvian jungle. Visit a local town, try local flavors, and savor the surrounding nature.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/www.hiddenjunglecusco.com\/live-like-a-local-4d-3n\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Hidden Jungle Cusco\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/hiddenjunglecusco\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2022-10-16T05:32:55+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/www.hiddenjunglecusco.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/202